<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Defs_L3_3_5_5" targetNamespace="https://teck.example/process-models/pillar-03">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collab_L3_3_5_5">
    <bpmn:participant id="Pool_L3_3_5_5" name="3.5.5 Facility Storage &amp; Safety Monitoring" processRef="Process_L3_3_5_5"/>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_L3_3_5_5" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>L1/L3 Process. Monitors pond level and freeboard, assesses storage capacity against the construction and deposition plans, and issues operating constraints when the facility is outside its operating criteria. This is the operational interface to geotechnical surveillance and emergency preparedness, which Pillar 6 governs.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_L3_3_5_5">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_3_5_5_eng" name="Tailings Facility Engineer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_L3_3_5_5_s</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_5_5_3_5_5_1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_5_5_3_5_5_2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gw_L3_3_5_5_g</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_3_5_5_e1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_5_5_3_5_5_3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_3_5_5_e2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_L3_3_5_5_s" name="Pond reading or survey received">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_5_1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_5_5_3_5_5_1" name="3.5.5.1 Monitor Pond Level and Freeboard">
      <bpmn:documentation>Pond level is measured continuously (level sensor) and pond area and volume periodically (survey or bathymetry). Freeboard is calculated against the approved reference and compared with the criterion. [WATER: level and volume (pond inventory) | level sensor + survey or bathymetry | continuous level / periodic volume | MCA WAF | YES — facility water storage; WP-11]
ISA-95 level: 1 / 2
Actors: Tailings Facility Engineer; Tailings Operator
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 1, 2; GISTM; MCA WAF
DDVC layer: Raw (time-series: pond_level_telemetry); Curated (tsf_inventory_record)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_5_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_5_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_5_5_3_5_5_2" name="3.5.5.2 Assess Storage Capacity Against Plan">
      <bpmn:documentation>Available storage is compared with the deposition forecast and the planned embankment raise (the race between construction rise and storage rise), to confirm that deposition and production can continue within the permitted operating conditions.
ISA-95 level: 3
Actors: Tailings Facility Engineer; Construction Supervisor / Surveyor
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Level 3; GISTM
DDVC layer: Curated (tsf_inventory_record — capacity)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_5_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_5_3</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_L3_3_5_5_g" name="Within operating criteria?" default="Flow_L3_3_5_5_4">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_5_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_5_4</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_5_5</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_3_5_5_e1" name="Facility status reported">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_5_4</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_5_5_3_5_5_3" name="3.5.5.3 Issue Facility Operating Constraint">
      <bpmn:documentation>When freeboard or capacity is outside the operating criteria, an operating constraint is issued to the plant and tailings operations: reduce tailings input or throughput, change the deposition location, increase reclaim, or start emergency water management. Pillar 6 is notified, because a TSF failure is a top-tier fatal hazard.
ISA-95 level: 3
Actors: Tailings Facility Engineer; Tailings Operator
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Level 3; GISTM; ICMM Fatal Hazard Control
DDVC layer: Curated (facility_operating_constraint)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_5_5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_5_6</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_3_5_5_e2" name="Operating constraint issued">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_5_6</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="Msg_L3_3_5_5_e2"/>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_5_1" sourceRef="Start_L3_3_5_5_s" targetRef="Task_L3_3_5_5_3_5_5_1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_5_2" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_5_5_3_5_5_1" targetRef="Task_L3_3_5_5_3_5_5_2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_5_3" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_5_5_3_5_5_2" targetRef="Gw_L3_3_5_5_g"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_5_4" name="Yes" sourceRef="Gw_L3_3_5_5_g" targetRef="End_L3_3_5_5_e1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_5_5" name="No" sourceRef="Gw_L3_3_5_5_g" targetRef="Task_L3_3_5_5_3_5_5_3"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_5_6" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_5_5_3_5_5_3" targetRef="End_L3_3_5_5_e2"/>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_L3_3_5_5">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_L3_3_5_5" bpmnElement="Collab_L3_3_5_5">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Pool_L3_3_5_5_di" bpmnElement="Pool_L3_3_5_5" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="20" y="20" width="1024" height="340"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_3_5_5_eng_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_3_5_5_eng" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="20" width="984" height="340"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Start_L3_3_5_5_s_di" bpmnElement="Start_L3_3_5_5_s"><dc:Bounds x="142" y="77" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="110" y="139" width="120" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_5_5_3_5_5_1_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_5_5_3_5_5_1"><dc:Bounds x="266" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_5_5_3_5_5_2_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_5_5_3_5_5_2"><dc:Bounds x="472" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Gw_L3_3_5_5_g_di" bpmnElement="Gw_L3_3_5_5_g" isMarkerVisible="true"><dc:Bounds x="728" y="70" width="70" height="70"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="657" y="20" width="100" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_3_5_5_e1_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_3_5_5_e1"><dc:Bounds x="916" y="77" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="884" y="139" width="120" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_5_5_3_5_5_3_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_5_5_3_5_5_3"><dc:Bounds x="678" y="235" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_3_5_5_e2_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_3_5_5_e2"><dc:Bounds x="916" y="247" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="884" y="309" width="120" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_5_1_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_5_1"><di:waypoint x="198" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="266" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_5_2_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_5_2"><di:waypoint x="436" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="472" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_5_3_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_5_3"><di:waypoint x="642" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="728" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_5_4_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_5_4"><di:waypoint x="798" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="916" y="105"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="802" y="85" width="27" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_5_5_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_5_5"><di:waypoint x="763" y="140"/><di:waypoint x="763" y="235"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="769" y="144" width="21" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_5_6_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_5_6"><di:waypoint x="848" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="916" y="275"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
